 is growing weaker, leading Yuichi to increase the amount of attention he gives her. Her condition grave, Yuichi recalls Mishio’s words - and he also remembers a fuller picture of Makoto’s past.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-12-01","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wobmKT5nz0Rzi5CGmQycKbEVnb8.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wobmKT5nz0Rzi5CGmQycKbEVnb8.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34124/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"782491","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuichi and Makoto spend a personal moment alone atop a special hill. As she tragically seems to slowly slip away from this world, his only focus is on making sure her wishes come true.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-12-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tklO9MbBm9VBONscHGpwWvwvLn6.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tklO9MbBm9VBONscHGpwWvwvLn6.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34124/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"782492","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yuichi discovers Mai’s bad reputation; she has a history of being blamed any time something bad happens on campus. Hoping to help her fix her image, Yuichi invites her to the school dance.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2006-12-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6CSiGCjEOJMMLHJ4q2MheDrz7Op.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6CSiGCjEOJMMLHJ4q2MheDrz7Op.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/34124/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"782493","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"t